        <a class="commenterIcon js-tooltipTrigger tooltipTrigger" data-resource-id="4600926" data-resource-type="User" data-extra="Group.4170" title="Jared (jaredforshey) | 32 comments" href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/4600926-jared"><img alt="Jared (jaredforshey) | 32 comments" src="https://images.gr-assets.com/users/1291145435p1/4600926.jpg" /></a>
      I'm doing a re-read of the Book of the New Sun right now and I'm really surprised by a lot of the little details that I didn't notice before. I can easily imagine that following the discussions here and on the podcast will reveal even more things I never considered. I'm noticing that whole scenes even "look" different inside my head because of new notions and feelings I've developed about the characters involved.
    <br/><br/>
